more. How much in all?", "t0": 15.09, "t1": 19.14, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "13 private provider numbers", "sub": "top 1% nationwide, three times the median"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.38, 0.64, 0.97, 1.1, 1.39, 1.69, 1.84, 2.49, 2.69, 3.43, 3.6, 3.79, 3.89]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "amount"], "text": "32 million dollars.", "t0": 19.14, "t1": 20.66, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$32.0 million", "label": "to 13 private San Francisco provider numbers"}, "emph": ["32"], "wt": [0.04, 0.54, 0.84]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat", "story[5]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. An outlier is a reason to look, not proof of anything.", "t0": 21.18, "t1": 25.99, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.35, 0.44, 0.86, 1.08, 1.18, 2.18, 2.38, 2.93, 3.05, 3.12, 3.39, 3.5, 3.82, 4.03, 4.31, 4.42]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "The first lead is price.", "t0": 26.21, "t1": 27.5, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["national median per claim", "1 times"], "b": ["these billers", "3 times or more"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.36, 0.56, 0.67]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "Top 1 percent for a service, and three times the usual price per claim, at once. That’s rare.", "t0": 27.62, "t1": 32.89, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["national median per claim", "1 times"], "b": ["these billers", "3 times or more"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.51, 0.88, 1.03, 1.12, 1.89, 2.08, 2.35, 2.66, 2.8, 3.09, 3.36, 3.51, 3.84, 4.04, 4.65, 4.95]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "13 numbers, 11 operators.", "t0": 33.01, "t1": 34.99, "shot":